{
  // Scoped typecheck project for the package's whole `test/` tree, run by
  // `check-types` as a SECOND `tsc` pass after the composite `tsc -b` — the
  // composite build emits declarations for `src` only and never sees `test/**`.
  // Without this project the tree is checked by no `tsc` at all: this package
  // had no `test/` directory until 19 test files arrived from `packages/api/test/`
  // — 16 from `test/contracts/`, 2 from `test/briefing/` and 1 from the tree
  // root — so nothing here had ever been in a program.
  //
  // `include` covers `test` rather than any file list, so a file added anywhere
  // under `test/` is type-checked without an edit here.
  //
  // The base `tsconfig.json` is `composite: true`; a `tsc -p` invocation with
  // `noEmit` errors unless `composite`/`declaration` are overridden off here.
  // Nothing under `test/` is emitted or built — this project only type-checks.
  //
  // `rootDir: "."` is also the fence, and it carries this package's one
  // structural rule: `@alfred/contracts` declares `zod` as its only runtime
  // dependency, and it depends on no package that depends on it. The one
  // `@alfred/*` entry it does carry is `@alfred/config` in `devDependencies`,
  // a build-config package that declares no dependency of its own and so
  // closes no loop. A package that depends on `@alfred/contracts` cannot be
  // reached from here, because a reach the other way closes a cycle. A suite
  // that names `@alfred/db` — at run time OR type-only, because `tsc` must
  // resolve an erased import too — belongs in `packages/db/test`, not here, and
  // a relative reach into another package's tree is TS6059 by design.
  //
  // No `exclude`: an `exclude` in a file like this is a baseline of debt a tree
  // arrived with, and this tree arrived clean. The one file that carried debt
  // out of `packages/api/test/` is `credentials/credential-vault.test.ts`, and
  // it went to `packages/db/test/` with its baseline entry attached.
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    "rootDir": ".",
    "composite": false,
    "declaration": false,
    "declarationMap": false,
    "sourceMap": false
  },
  "include": ["src", "test"]
}
